  "title": "AI and Chatbot Fraud Detection in Real-Time",
  "summary": "A study by arXiv AI presents a real-time chatbot detection method to identify romance scams, while the documentary 'Super Scam Me' highlights the methods used to catch romance scammer. Florida authorities are seeking a court order to block the development of OpenAI’s AI model, ChatGPT, to address concerns about its potential to mislead users into believing it can act as a real person. Snapchat has adjusted its recommendation systems to prevent AI slop, while Google introduces a selfie video as a new sign-in method for accounts.",
